{"answerArea":{"calculator":true,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\n(r-14)^2-56.25\u0026=0\n\\\\\\\\\n(r-14)^2\u0026=56.25\n\\\\\\\\\n\\sqrt{(r-14)^2}\u0026=\\sqrt{56.25}\n\\\\\\\\\nr-14\u0026=\\pm 7.5\n\\\\\\\\\nr\u0026=\\pm7.5+14\n\\\\\\\\\nr=\\goldD{6.5}\u0026\\text{ or }r=\\goldD{21.5}\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$f(r)$ is given in vertex form:\n\n$f(r)=(r-\\blueD{14})^2\\maroonD{-56.25}$\n\nSo the vertex of the parabola is at $(\\blueD{14},\\maroonD{-56.25})$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion,\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\\text{smaller }r\u0026=6.5\n\\\\\\\\\n\\text{larger }r\u0026=21.5\n\\end{align}$\n\nThe vertex of the parabola is at\n\n$(14,-56.25)$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$f(r)=(r-14)^2-56.25$\n\n**1) What are the zeros of the function?**  \n*Write the smaller $r$ first, and the larger $r$ second.*\n\n$\\text{smaller }r=$ [[☃ input-number 1]]\n\n$\\text{larger }r=$ [[☃ input-number 2]]\n\n**2) What is the vertex of the parabola?**\n\n$($[[☃ input-number 3]]$,$[[☃ input-number 4]]$)$","images":{},"widgets":{"input-number 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"rightAlign":false,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":6.5},"static":false,"type":"input-number","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}},"input-number 2":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"rightAlign":false,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":21.5},"static":false,"type":"input-number","version":{"major":0,"minor":0}},"input-number 3":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"answerType":"number","inexact":false,"maxError":0.1,"rightAlign":false,"simplify":"required","size":"normal","value":14},"static":false,"type":"input-number",